        "original_id": "19635f14-a0b6-5d6f-806e-841644fed544",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Javier Hernández, Antonio Valencia, Dimitar Berbatov, Salomon Kalou\n- Events: 2010 FA Community Shield\n- Concepts: Chicharito\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2010 FA Community Shield, Manchester United won 3–1 against Chelsea.\n- In the 2010 FA Community Shield, Antonio Valencia, Javier Hernández, and Dimitar Berbatov scored for Manchester United.\n- In the 2010 FA Community Shield, Salomon Kalou scored Chelsea's only goal.\n- Javier Hernández is commonly known by the nickname Chicharito, which means \"little pea\" in Mexican Spanish.\n- Javier Hernández wears the nickname Chicharito on his shirt.",
